<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Ayta Ambala Retelling Version</book>
  <para style="toc3">Efe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Efeso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hay Sulat Pablo ha libun tiga Efeso</para>
  <para style="mt2">Hay Sulat Pablo ha libun tiga Efeso</para>
  <para style="mt">Tiga Efeso</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1"/>Haku hi Pabloy alagad Apu Jesu Cristo ayun ha kaluuban Apu Diyus.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Nanyulataku kayun libun tiga Efeso ya pinilin Apu Diyus buy tapat kan Apu Jesu Cristo.<verse eid="EPH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2"/>Indadalangin kun mapakayuy kahampatan buy kapayapaanaꞌ ibat ha Bapa tamun hi Apu Diyus buy ha Panginuun tamun hi Apu Jesu Cristo.<verse eid="EPH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3-4"/>Puriin tamu hi Apu Diyus ya Bapan Panginuun tamun hi Apu Jesu Cristo. Ta ha pakikigiha tamu kan Apu Jesus, inꞌibi na kantamuy laataꞌ pagpapalan ibat ha langit. Bayu na pun likhaênaꞌ mundu, ha pamêmêêtan pakikigiha tamu kan Apu Jesu Cristo, pinili nay na kitamu takay magin banal buy alan maakitaꞌ malaêt ha pamalayan na. Ta ha pagmamaal na kantamu, <verse eid="EPH 1:3-4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5"/>hinhatu puniꞌ intalaga nay na kitamu takay magin awꞌanak na ha pamêmêêtan Apu Jesu Cristo. Ta habayinaꞌ labay na buy kaluuban na, <verse eid="EPH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6"/>taêmên puriin tamu hi Apu Diyus ta ha makapagtaka nang biyayan inꞌibi na kantamu ha pamêmêêtan minamaal nan Anak.<verse eid="EPH 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7-8"/>Ha pamêmêêtan dayan Apu Jesus, tinubus kitamuy na, ya hay labay sabin pinatawadanay kawkasalanan tamu. Alan katbuhaꞌ biyayan impagkaluub kantamun Apu Diyus, ta binyanan na kitamun kabiyahaan buy pagkatêbêk, <verse eid="EPH 1:7-8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9"/>takay matêbêkaꞌ lihimaꞌ planu na ya labay nan matupad ha pamêmêêtan Apu Jesu Cristo. <verse eid="EPH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10"/>Atiyaꞌ planu na: paglatêng takdang panawun paggihaên nay dilag ha langit buy ha luta, ya magin sakupanan kapangyarian Apu Jesu Cristo.<verse eid="EPH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11"/>Ginagawan Apu Diyus ya laataꞌ bagay ayun ha planu buy kaluuban na. Buy ayun ha planu na hinhatu pun, pinili na kami takay magin kana ha pamêmêêtan pakikigiha kan Apu Jesus. <verse eid="EPH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12"/>Ginawa nay habatu takay hakamin ni unan nanampalataya kan Apu Jesus magpuri kana. <verse eid="EPH 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13"/>Hakaw man nakigiha kawu kan Apu Jesu Cristo hin nalêngê yuy kapêtêgan, ya hay Mahampataꞌ Balita nu pakapakun kawun miligtas. Ta ha pananampalataya yu kana, inꞌibi nay Ispiritu na ya impangaku na bilang tanda ya pagꞌaari na kawu. <verse eid="EPH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14"/>Hay Banalaꞌ Ispirituy inꞌibi na kantamu taêmên magpatunayaꞌ matanggap tamuy ibat ha Apu Diyus ya impangaku na kantamun awꞌanak na, anggan ha matanggap tamuy lubusaꞌ kaligtasan. Dahilan kayti puriin ya ta ha kahampatan na!<verse eid="EPH 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hay Panalangin Pablo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15"/>Kaya ban, hin nabalitꞌan kuy pananampalataya yu ha Panginuun Jesus buy hay pagmamaal yu ha pawpinilin Apu Diyus, <verse eid="EPH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16"/>panayaꞌ pasasalamat ku kan Apu Diyus dahilan kayu. Buy panay kitawun impapanalangin. <verse eid="EPH 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17"/>Impipikikwa ku kan Apu Diyus, ya dakilan Bapan Panginuun tamun hi Apu Jesu Cristo, ya biyan na kawun kabiyahaan buy pagkatêbêkaꞌ ibat ha Banalaꞌ Ispiritu takay lalu yu ya pun makilala. <verse eid="EPH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18"/>Impapanalangin ku mêtaꞌ pahawangên nay pusu yu buy ihipan takay matêbêk yuy pagꞌasan inlaan na kantamu, hay maalaga buy kasaganaanaꞌ pagpapala ya impangaku na ha libun pinili na. <verse eid="EPH 1:18"/><verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19-20"/>Impapanalangin ku mêt kan Apu Diyus ya matandan yuy alan katbuhaꞌ kapangyarihan na para kantamun mananampalataya na. Hay kapangyarihanaꞌ atiyaꞌ ginamit na hin binyay nan uman hi Apu Jesus, buy hin pinaitnu nay na ha kanan na istu ha langit. <verse eid="EPH 1:19-20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21"/>Kaya dilag ha lalên kapangyarihan Apu Jesus ya laataꞌ anitun naghahari, namamaala, awꞌanitun namumunu buy mayin kapangyarihan. Hay tungkulin nay ahê mapantayan hitalagyuman, alwan dili ha panawunaꞌ ati, nu alwan ha lumatêng punaꞌ panawun. <verse eid="EPH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22"/>Impagkatiwalan Apu Diyus kan Apu Jesu Cristoy laataꞌ bagay, buy ginawa yan pinunun laat ha ikahampat mananampalatayan miaawyun, <verse eid="EPH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23"/>ya hiyan pinakanawinin Apu Jesus. Hay laataꞌ mananampalatayan miaawyun hilay pinakanawinin Apu Jesus ya hiyay kabuuan laat.<verse eid="EPH 1:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Binyay Kawu Kaawyun Hi Apu Jesu Cristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1"/>Hin hatu, inturing kawun natin Apu Diyus ta ha ah yu paghunul buy ha libun kasalanan yu. <verse eid="EPH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2"/>Nanabiyay kawun nambuh ha tawtawung makamundu. Buy nagpasakup kawu ha kapangyarihan Satanas, ya harin libun anitu ha mundu ya hiya mêtaꞌ anitun manguna ha pusun tawtawu ya ahê hinuhumunul kan Apu Diyus. <verse eid="EPH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3"/>Hinhatu, nanabiyay kitamun mêt laat katbuh la. Nanabiyay kitamu ha malaêtaꞌ kalabayan nawini tamu, buy hinuhunul tamuy mangalaêtaꞌ labay nawini tamu buy kaihipan. Ha kalagayan tamun bantu, awyun kitamu mêt hana ha parusan Apu Diyus.<verse eid="EPH 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4"/>Nuwa maiingaluunaꞌ Apu Diyus buy talagan dakilay pagmamaal na kantamu, <verse eid="EPH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5"/>ta maski inturing na kitamun nati gawan ha libun kasalanan tamu, binyay na kitamun uman kaawyun Apu Jesus. Buy ha biyayan Apu Diyus, niligtas kitamu. <verse eid="EPH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6"/>Buy binyay kitamun Apu Diyus kaawyun Apu Jesu Cristo ta ha pakikigiha tamu kana, takay makaawyun na kitamun maghari ha kaharian na ha langit. <verse eid="EPH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7"/>Ginawa nay habaytu takay ha lumatêngaꞌ panawun, maipakit na ha laataꞌ ah mapantayanaꞌ kasaganaan biyaya na ha kahampatan na kantamu ha pamêmêêtan Apu Jesu Cristo. <verse eid="EPH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8"/>Ta ha pamêmêêtan biyayan Apu Diyus, niligtas kawu hin nanampalataya kawu kan Apu Jesus, alwan ibataꞌ ati ha sarili yu nu alwan kaluubaꞌ atin Apu Diyus. <verse eid="EPH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9"/>Ah kawu miligtas ha pamêmêêtan libun mangahampataꞌ gawa yu, takay alan maipagyabangaꞌ hitalagyuman. <verse eid="EPH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10"/>Ta inlikha kitamun Apu Diyus. Buy ha pakikigiha tamu kan Apu Jesu Cristo, binyanan na kitamun bayun biyay, takay manggawa kitamun kahampatanaꞌ hinhatu puniꞌ intalagay nan Apu Diyus ya gawꞌên tamu.<verse eid="EPH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hay pagkakagiha kan Apu Jesu Cristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11"/>Kaya hakawun libun alwan Judio, ihipin yuy kalagayan yu hinhatu. Impanganak kawun alwan Judio buy innununghung libun Judio ya ah kawu nangingilala kan Apu Diyus ta ah la kawu katbuhaꞌ tuli. Nuwa hay pagkakatuli la, ha nawini dili ya gawan tawu. <verse eid="EPH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12"/>Pakaihipin yu mêtaꞌ hinhatun ah yu pun kilala hi Apu Jesu Cristo, ah kawu kabilang ha tiga Israel buy ah kawu sakup ha libun kasunduan Apu Diyus ayun ha pangaku na. Nabyay kawu ha mundun atin alan pagꞌasa buy alan kilalan Diyus. <verse eid="EPH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13"/>Hinhatu madayu kawu kan Apu Diyus, nuwa hapaêg ha pamêmêêtan dayan Apu Jesus, naidani kawuy na kana.<verse eid="EPH 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14"/>Hi Apu Jesu Cristoy pinangibatan kapayapaan tamu ta pinaggiha nay Hawjudio buy hay alwan Hawjudio. Buy ha pamêmêêtan pagkapaku na ha krus, inalih nay kapuutan ha balang giha nambuh pagkagiban padiraꞌ mamihiyay ha Hawjudio buy alwan Judio. <verse eid="EPH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15"/>Winalꞌan nan alagay kautuhan, kaawyunaꞌ libun utuh buy libun patakaran ati. Ginawa nay ati takay paggihaênaꞌ Hawjudio buy alwan Judio, ta baistu magkasunduy nay luwa. <verse eid="EPH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16"/>Hapaêgaꞌ gigihay nawini kitamuy na ha pamêmêêtan pagkamatiꞌ na ha krus, inalih nay nay patiyan tamu buy impagkasundu na kitamu kan Apu Diyus.<verse eid="EPH 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17"/>Naku hi Apu Jesu Cristo kayti ha mundu takay ipangaral nay Mahampataꞌ Balitan naykasundu kayun alwan Hawjudio ya hin una madayu kawu kan Apu Diyus. Maski kanyan mêtaꞌ Hawjudio ya madani kan Apu Diyus, impangaral na mêt kanyanaꞌ Mahampataꞌ Balita. <verse eid="EPH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18"/>Hapaêg, pariparihu kitamuy nan makadani kan Apu Diyus ha pamêmêêtan kagigihay Banalaꞌ Ispiritu ta ha ginawan Apu Jesu Cristo para kantamu.<verse eid="EPH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19"/>Kaya hakawun alwan Hawjudio, alwa kawuy nan dayuhan u tiga ibang bansa, nu alwan kabilang kawuy na ha pawpinilin Apu Diyus buy kabilang kawuy na ha pamilyan Apu Diyus. <verse eid="EPH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20"/>Hakitamun libun mananampalataya, maiitbuh ha gihay biyagaꞌ batu ya hay haligi, hay awꞌalagad buy libun tagapannunghung, buy hay maalagan batun pundasyun hi Apu Jesu Cristo. <verse eid="EPH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21"/>Ha pamêmêêtan Apu Jesu Cristo, magkakatugnuy laat kagamitan ha biyagaꞌ batu buy magin gihay banalaꞌ timplun Panginuun. <verse eid="EPH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22"/>Hakawun alwan Hawjudio ta ha pakikigiha yu kan Apu Jesu Cristo, naitugnu kawuy na ha libun Judio, ya nambuh kagamitan ha Timplun pinamimirmiyan Ispiritun Apu Diyus.<verse eid="EPH 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Hay Planun Apu Diyus ha Alwan Hawjudio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1"/>Ta habatuy ginawan Apu Diyus, hakun hi Pabloy nabilanggu ta ha paglilingkud ku kan Apu Jesu Cristo ha pamêmêêtan awun panunudu ku para kayun alwan Hawjudio. <verse eid="EPH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2"/>Siguradun nabalitꞌan yun impagkatiwala kangkun Apu Diyus ya panunudun Mahampataꞌ Balita kayu. <verse eid="EPH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3"/>Katbuh ha innunghung ku ha sulataꞌ ati, impatanda kangkun Apu Diyus ya lihimaꞌ planu na. <verse eid="EPH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4"/>Kaban binabasa yuy sulat kun ati, matandan yuy pagkatêbêk ku ha lihimaꞌ planun Apu Diyus tungkul kan Apu Jesu Cristo. <verse eid="EPH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5"/>Alwan impatandan Apu Diyus ya planun ati ha tawtawu hinhatu, nuwa hapaêg, ha pamêmêêtan Banalaꞌ Ispiritu, impangaral nay ati ha libun alagad na buy libun tagapannunghung na.<verse eid="EPH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6"/>Ati bayaꞌ planun Apu Diyus. Ha pamêmêêtan Mahampataꞌ Balita tungkul kan Apu Jesu Cristo, hay alwan Hawjudio, tagapagmana mêt pangakun Apu Diyus kaawyunaꞌ Hawjudio, buy nambuh mêtanaꞌ hilan gigihay nawini ta ha pakikigiha la kan Apu Jesu Cristo.<verse eid="EPH 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7"/>Ta ha biyayan Apu Diyus buy ha pamêmêêtan kapangyarihan na, nagin tagapangaralakun Mahampataꞌ Balita. <verse eid="EPH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8"/>Maski hakuy pinakamayêpa ha laat mananampalataya, piniliyaku pun Apu Diyus takay ipangaral ku ha alwan Hawjudioy ahê mapantayanaꞌ biyayan ibat kan Apu Jesu Cristo, <verse eid="EPH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9"/>buy ipatanda ku ha laat nu pakapakun matupadaꞌ planun Apu Diyus. Hi Apu Diyusaꞌ naylikhan laataꞌ bagay, hin una inlihim nay planu na, <verse eid="EPH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10"/>taêmên ha pamêmêêtan mananampalatayan miaawyun, maipatanda ha libun anghilaꞌ namumunu buy mayin katungkulan ha langit, hay kabiyahaan Apu Diyus ya naipangaral ha iba iban paraan. <verse eid="EPH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11"/>Ati ya planu na hin umpisa pun, buy natupadanay ati ha pamêmêêtan Apu Jesu Cristo ya Panginuun tamu. <verse eid="EPH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12"/>Ta ha pakikigiha kan Apu Jesu Cristo buy ha pananampalataya tamu kana, makadani kitamuy na kan Apu Diyus ya alan limu buy alan alinlangan. <verse eid="EPH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13"/>Kaya hinihiling kun ah kawu hana pangꞌinaan luub ta ha libun pagꞌiirapaꞌ dinadanas ku, ta para ha ikahampat yuy ati.<verse eid="EPH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hay Pagmamaal Apu Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14"/>Nu naaalala kuy planun Apu Diyus, magluhudaku ya magpupuri kana. <verse eid="EPH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15"/>Hiyay Bapan libun dilag ha langit buy dilag ha luta ya intuturing nan buung pamilya. <verse eid="EPH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16"/>Impapanalangin ku kana ya palakasên nay luub yu ha pamêmêêtan Ispiritu na, ayun ha alang angganaꞌ kahampatan buy kapangyarihan na, <verse eid="EPH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17"/>taêmên mamirmi hi Apu Jesu Cristo ha pawpusu yu ha pamêmêêtan pananampalataya yu. Impapanalangin ku mêtaꞌ magin matibay kawu buy matatag ha pagmamaal Apu Diyus <verse eid="EPH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18"/>takay matêbêk yu buy kanayun mêtaꞌ pinilin Apu Diyus nu antun kamhak, kakadang, katagꞌay buy nu pakapakun kalalêy pagmamaal Apu Jesu Cristo kantamu. <verse eid="EPH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19"/>Labay kun madanasan yuy alwan mapantayanaꞌ pagmamaal na taêmên magin ganap kawuy katangian Apu Diyus.<verse eid="EPH 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20"/>Kaya puriin tamu hi Apu Diyus ya makagawan higit pun ha impipikikwa u inaasahan tamu ha pamêmêêtan kapangyarihan nan kinukumilus kantamu. <verse eid="EPH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21"/>Puriin tamu hi Apu Diyus makanuman ta ha ginawa na para ha mananampalatayan miaawyun ya dilag kan Apu Jesu Cristo. Amen.<verse eid="EPH 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Nagkagihay libun mananampalataya kan Apu Jesu Cristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1"/>Kaya bilang gihay bilanggu ta ha paglilingkud ha Panginuun, hinihiling kun mabyay kawun karapatdapat bilang libun binawêg Apu Diyus. <verse eid="EPH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2"/>Magin mahinahun kawu, mapagpakayêpa, maunawaên buy mapagpasinsiya ha pagkukulang balan giha bilang pagpapakit pagmamaal ha balang giha. <verse eid="EPH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3"/>Pagsikapan yun ahê maalihaꞌ pagkakagiha yu ibat ha Ispiritun Apu Diyus ha pamêmêêtan mapayapan pamiaawyun yu. <verse eid="EPH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4"/>Ta gigihay nawini kitamun dili ya mayin gigihay Ispiritun Apu Diyus, buy gigiha mêtaꞌ pagꞌasang inꞌibi kantamu hin binawêg kitamun Apu Diyus. <verse eid="EPH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5"/>Gigihay Panginuun tamun hi Apu Jesus, gigihay pananampalataya, buy gigiha mêtaꞌ bawtismu. <verse eid="EPH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6"/>Gigiha hi Apu Diyus ya hiyay Bapa tamun laat. Naghahari ya ha laat, kinukumilus ya buy namimirmi kantamun laat. <verse eid="EPH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7"/>Nuwa maski bahagiꞌ kitamun gigihay nawini, binyanan nay balang giha kantamun kakayaan ayun ha kaluuban Apu Jesus. <verse eid="EPH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8"/>Katbuh ha innununghung ha Kasulatan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">“Hin nagdakêy ya ha langit, gintan nay kanan nangadakêp</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">buy binyanan nay naman biyayay tawtawu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kawkanta 68:18.</char></note><verse eid="EPH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9"/>Hapaêg, hita kayay kaulugan awun, “Nagdakêy ya ha langit?” Hay labay sabin ati, bayu ya nagdakêy uman ha langit, nagtabuy ya pun kayti ha luta. <verse eid="EPH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10"/>Buy hay nagtabuy kayti ha luta, hiya mêtaꞌ nagdakêy ha katagꞌay tagꞌayan langit takay magin lubusaꞌ kapangyarihan na ha laataꞌ bagay.<verse eid="EPH 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11"/>Hay kanayun ginawa nan alagad, hay kanayun ginawa nan tagapannunghung Apu Diyus, buy hay kanayun ginawa nan maypatandan Mahampataꞌ Balita, buy hay kanayunaꞌ naman ginawa nan mangalênggêp libun mananampalataya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">U pastor.</char></note> buy maytudu kanla. <verse eid="EPH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12"/>Ginawa nay ati takay ihanday pawpinili na ha paglilingkud, buy takay lumagu buy magin matatag hila bilang nawinin Apu Jesus. <verse eid="EPH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13"/>Ha paraanaꞌ ati, maabut tamun laataꞌ pagkakagiha ha pananampalataya buy pagkakilala ha Anak Apu Diyus, buy lumagu kitamun mananampalataya anggan ha magin ganap kitamun katbuh Apu Jesu Cristo. <verse eid="EPH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14"/>Ta nu maabut tamuy nay ati, alwa kitamuy nan katbuh anakaꞌ pabayuꞌbayuy ihip ya naaagkat tawtawu ha kamalaêtan, ya hay hangad la, gitanaꞌ tawtawu ha malukê. <verse eid="EPH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15"/>Ha halip, mannunghung kitamun kapêtêgan ya mayin pagmamaal takay ha laat bagay magin katbuh kitamun Apu Jesus ya hiyan pinakaꞌ u tamun libun mananampalataya. <verse eid="EPH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16"/>Ha pamêmêêtan na, pinitutugnu nay laataꞌ bahagin nawini na, ya alan kanayun nu alwan hay libun mananampalataya buy hay balang gihay mitutulung. Buy hay balan hinuhumunul ha impapagawan Apu Jesu Cristo ya mayin pagmamaal, inlulumagu buy tinutumatagaꞌ buun nawini.<verse eid="EPH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hay Bayun Biyay kan Apu Jesu Cristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17"/>Ha lagyun Panginuun, impipilit kun ah kawuy na mamuhay katbuh tawtawung alwan nakakakilala kan Apu Diyus. Ta alan silbiyaꞌ inihip la, <verse eid="EPH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18"/>buy ah la natêtêbêkaꞌ libun kapêtêganaꞌ tungkul kan Apu Diyus. Ta ha ala hilan tanda buy mangatigasaꞌ u la, ala hilan bayun biyay ya inꞌibin Apu Diyus. <verse eid="EPH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19"/>Alay na hilan kadêdêngꞌêyan, kaya nagpasakupanaꞌ hila ha mangaalaya kalabayan nawini la buy labay lan panay manggawan kadêmêkan.<verse eid="EPH 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20"/>Nuwa hakawu, alwan habatuy natandan yu tungkul kan Apu Jesu Cristo. <verse eid="EPH 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21"/>Nalêngê yuy nay tungkul kan Apu Jesus buy natuduwanan kawuy nan kapêtêganaꞌ dilag kana. <verse eid="EPH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22"/>Kaya alihin yuy nay daan yun pamumuhay ta gawꞌênaꞌ atin daan yung pagkatawu. Hay pagkatawu yun ati ya naypapahamak kayu ta ha mangalaêtaꞌ kalabayanaꞌ nanluluku kayu. <verse eid="EPH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23"/>Paulayên yun bayuun Apu Diyus ya ihip yu buy ugali yu. <verse eid="EPH 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24"/>Ipakit yun binayu kawuy nan Apu Diyus buy binyan na kawun bayun biyay ya matuynung buy malinis katbuh Apu Diyus. <verse eid="EPH 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25"/>Kaya ah kawuy na magsinungaling. Kapêtêgan tanay nunghungun yu ha pawpatêl yu, ta miaawyun kitamun laat ha gigihay nawini. <verse eid="EPH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26"/>Nu mapuut kawu, ah yu paulayênaꞌ magkasala kawu. Buy ah yu paulayên dumanaꞌ allêwaꞌ puut kawu pun ha pawpatêl yu. <verse eid="EPH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27"/>Ah yu biyan pagkakatawun hi Satanas.<verse eid="EPH 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28"/>Hay magnanakaw, andi yana manakaw, nu alwan magtrabahu yan marangal takay makatulung ya mêt ha nangangaylangan. <verse eid="EPH 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29"/>Ah kawu mannunghung malaêt nu alwan hay makahampat dili buy angkup ha kalagayan takay magin pakinabang ha nakakalêngê. <verse eid="EPH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30"/>Buy ah yu palungkutanaꞌ Ispiritun Apu Diyus. Ta hay Ispirituy tatak ya kan Apu Diyus kawu, buy hiyay katibayan kaligtasan yu pangalatêng allêw.<verse eid="EPH 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31"/>Alihin yuy hitamanaꞌ hakit nakêm, puut, patiyan, pambubulas, panghihira ha kaparihu, pati laataꞌ kalasin mangalaêtaꞌ hangarên. <verse eid="EPH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32"/>Ha halip, magin mabait kawu buy magin maingaluun ha balang giha. Buy magpatawad kawu ha balang giha katbuh pagpapatawad Apu Diyus kayu, ta ha ginawan Apu Jesu Cristo.<verse eid="EPH 4:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Mamuhay katbuh tawtawung nahawangan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1"/>Kaya tubhun yu hi Apu Diyus, ta hakawun laataꞌ minamaal nan awꞌanak. <verse eid="EPH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2"/>Mamuhay kawun mayin pagmamaal ha kaparihu yu katbuh pagmamaal kantamun Apu Jesus. Inꞌalay nay sarili na kantamu bilang kalugudlugudaꞌ handug kan Apu Diyus.<verse eid="EPH 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3"/>Ta pinili na kawu, ah kawu dapat kalêngꞌan manggawan malaswa, mangaalay buy sakimaꞌ giha man kayu. <verse eid="EPH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4"/>Buy andi dapat malêngê kayuy mangalaswa u alan silbi ya nunghungan u mangalaêtaꞌ biru. Nu alwan panay kawun mapagpasalamat kan Apu Diyus. <verse eid="EPH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5"/>Tandaan yu, alan tawun mapaawyun ha kaharian Apu Jesu Cristo buy Apu Diyus ya nakikitakpi, mangaalay ya pamumuhay, u sakim. Ta hay tawun sakim katbuh mêt nanampalataya ha libun diyusdiyusan.<verse eid="EPH 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6"/>Ah kawu magpaguluy ha alan silbin pangangatwiran kanayun tungkul ha mangalaêt lan gawaên. Ta ha bawbagayaꞌ ati, puutaꞌ puut hi Apu Diyus ha libun ah hinuhumunul kana. <verse eid="EPH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7"/>Kaya ah kawu makiawyun ha ginagawan tawtawung ati. <verse eid="EPH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8"/>Hinhatu nanabiyay kawu ha kadlêman, nuwa hapaêg, nahawangan kawuy na ta nakigiha kawuy na ha Panginuun. Kaya ipakit yu ha pamumuhay yuy nahawangan kawuy na. <verse eid="EPH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9"/>Ta nu hay gihay tawuy nahawanganana, maakit kanay kahampatan, katuynungan, buy kapêtêgan. <verse eid="EPH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10"/>Pakatandan yu nu hita kalugudlugud ha Panginuun. <verse eid="EPH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11"/>Ah kawu makiaawyun ha libun alan silbi ya ginagawan tawtawung dilag ha kadlêman, ha halip, ipatanda yu kanlay kamalaêtan la. <verse eid="EPH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12"/>Ta kadêngꞌêy dêngꞌêy sabin maski pinununghungan diliyaꞌ bawbagayaꞌ ginagawa lan lihim. <verse eid="EPH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13"/>Nuwa nu patandan yu hila ha mangalaêtaꞌ gawaên la, mahawangan hila buy matandan lan malaêt bayaꞌ libun ginagawa la. <verse eid="EPH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14"/>Ta hay laat maabut kapêtêgan, mahawanganana. Kaya bay innununghung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">“Mapukaw ka, hakan natutuluy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">mibangun ka ibat ha nawnati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">buy hawangan kan Apu Jesus.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15"/>Kaya magꞌingat kawu nu pakapakun kawun mamuhay. Ah kawu mamuhay katbuh libun alwan biyaha, nu alwan mamuhay kawun katbuh bawbiyaha. <verse eid="EPH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16"/>Ah yu sayangênaꞌ panawun yu. Gamitin yuy ati ha panggawan mahampat, ta dêlay nanggagawan kamalaêtan ha panawunaꞌ ati. <verse eid="EPH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17"/>Kaya ah kawu magin muwmulala, nu alwan pakatandan yu nu hita kaluuban Panginuun ya gawꞌên yu.<verse eid="EPH 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18"/>Ah kawu maglahing ta nakakahiday ati ha mahampataꞌ pamumuhay. Ha halip, paulayan yung mapuspus kawun Ispiritun Apu Diyus. <verse eid="EPH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19"/>Ha pamiaawyun yu, magkantaan kawun libun ibaꞌiban kalasin kanta para kan Apu Diyus. Buun pusu kawun magkanta buy magpuri ha Panginuun. <verse eid="EPH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20"/>Panay kawun magpasalamat kan Apu Diyus ya Bapa tamu ha laataꞌ bagay bilang mananampalatayan Apu Jesu Cristo.<verse eid="EPH 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aral ha libun Miahawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21"/>Magpasakup kawu ha balan giha bilang paggalang kan Apu Jesu Cristo. <verse eid="EPH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22"/>Bawbabayi, magpasakup kawu ha kayung ahawa katbuh pagpapasakup yu ha Panginuun. <verse eid="EPH 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23"/>Ta hay liyaki hiyay pinaka u awun ahawa na, katbuh Apu Jesus ya pinaka u awun mananampalataya ya hiyan pinakanawini na, buy hiya mêtaꞌ tagapagligtas mananampalatayan miaawyun. <verse eid="EPH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24"/>Kaya nu pakapakun nagpapasakupaꞌ mananampalatayan miaawyun kan Apu Jesus, habatu mêtaꞌ bawbabayi magpasakup mêt hila ha ahawa la ha laataꞌ bagay.<verse eid="EPH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25"/>Kaliyakyan, maalên yuy ahawa yu, katbuh pagmamaal Apu Jesu Cristo ha mananampalatayang miaawyun. Inꞌalay nay sarili na para ha mananampalatayang miaawyun <verse eid="EPH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26"/>taêmên magin banal hila pagkayarin linisin ha pamêmêêtan pagbawtismu ha lanêm buy ha nunghung Apu Diyus. <verse eid="EPH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27"/>Ginawa nay ati takay maiarap nay kanang sarili ha libun mananampalatayan miaawyun ya banal, alan kapintasan, buy alan hitamanaꞌ bahid dungis. <verse eid="EPH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28"/>Habatu mêtaꞌ naman, dapat maalên liyaki hay kanang ahawa katbuh pagmamaal na ha kanang sarili. Ta hay nagmamaal ha kanang ahaway nagmamaal ha sarili na. <verse eid="EPH 5:28"/><verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29-30"/>Alan tawun nasusuklam ha sarili nan nawini, ha halip, pinapakan nay ati buy inaalênggêp. Habatu mêtaꞌ ginagawan Apu Jesus kantamu ya binabawêgaꞌ mananampalatayan miaawyun ta bahagiꞌ kitamuy nan nawini na.<verse eid="EPH 5:29-30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31"/>Innununghung ha Kasulatan, “Itayak liyaki ya bapa na buy indu na buy makiawyun ya ha kanang ahawa buy hilan luway magin giha.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32"/>Malalêy kapêtêganaꞌ impahayag Apu Diyus. Impapakit kaytiya ugnayan awun Apu Jesus buy mananampalatayan miaawyun. <verse eid="EPH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33"/>Kaya hakawun libun kaliyakiyan, maalên yuy ahawa yu katbuh pagmamaal yu ha sarili yu. Buy hakawun bawbabayi, igalang yuy kayung ahawa.<verse eid="EPH 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6"/>
  <para style="s">Aral ha Mangatuwa buy Awꞌanak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1"/>Hakawun awꞌanak, hunulun yuy mangatuwa yu ta habatuy dapat gawꞌên bilang libun mananampalataya ha Panginuun. <verse eid="EPH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2"/>“Igalang yuy bapa yu buy indu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Exo 20:12</ref>;</char> <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 5:16">Deu 5:16</ref></char>.</char></note> Atiyaꞌ unan utuh ya mayin kaawyunaꞌ pangaku. <verse eid="EPH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3"/>“Nu igalang yuy mangatuwa yu magin mahampat buy kumadangaꞌ biyay yu kayti ha mundu.”<verse eid="EPH 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4"/>Buy hakawuy namanaꞌ mangatuwa, ah kawu manggawan bagayaꞌ ikahakit nakêm awꞌanak yu. Ha halip, pakamhakên yu hilan mahampat buy tuduwanan yu hilan awꞌaralaꞌ ibat ha Panginuun.<verse eid="EPH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aral ha awꞌalipên buy ha awꞌamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5"/>Hakawun awꞌalipên, hunulun yuy awꞌamu yu kayti ha luta ya mayin katapatan, paggalang buy pagkalimun dapay hi Apu Jesus ya pinaglilingkuran yu. <verse eid="EPH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6"/>Gawꞌên yuy atin mayin kusan luub nakabalay man hila u alwa takay matula hila, ta awꞌalipên kawun Apu Jesu Cristo ya buun pusun nanggagawan kaluuban Apu Diyus. <verse eid="EPH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7"/>Maglingkud kawun buun pusu dapay ha Panginuun ya talagan pinaglilingkuran yu buy alwan dilin hay tawu. <verse eid="EPH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8"/>Alalahanên yuy gantimpalan Panginuun ha balan giha kayu ayun ha ginawa nan kahampatan, alipên man u alwa.<verse eid="EPH 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9"/>Buy hakawuy namanaꞌ awꞌamu, pakisamaan yun mahampataꞌ kayung awꞌalipên. Ah yu hila palimun, ta tanda yuy naman ya hakawu buy hila mayin gigihay amu ha langit, buy ah ya namimili.<verse eid="EPH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Libun Kagamitanaꞌ Pandigma ya Kaluub Apu Diyus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10"/>Atiyaꞌ pagtatapus sulat ku, magpakatatag kawu ha Panginuun ha pamêmêêtan dakilan kapangyarihan na. <verse eid="EPH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11"/>Gamitin yuy laataꞌ kagamitanaꞌ pandigma ya inꞌibi kayun Apu Diyus takay malabanan yuy libun mangalaêtaꞌ gawan Satanas. <verse eid="EPH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12"/>Ta hay kalaban tamuy alwan tawtawu nu alwan awꞌanitu ha babun luta, pawpinunu, mayin kapangyarihan buy libun tagapamaalan kadlêmanaꞌ namamayaniꞌ ha mundun ati. <verse eid="EPH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13"/>Kaya gamitin yuy laataꞌ kagamitan pandigma ya inꞌibi kayun Apu Diyus, takay ha urasaꞌ lumatêngaꞌ kamalaêtan, matatag kawu, buy pagkayari yun makipaglaban, manatili kawun malakas.<verse eid="EPH 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14"/>Kaya magin handa kawu. Gawꞌên yun sinturunaꞌ kapêtêgan. Isuut yuy pagkamatuynung yu bilang panyanga ha dêbdêb yu. <verse eid="EPH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15"/>Isuut yu bilang sapatus ya nakahandang manudun Mahampataꞌ Balitan nanamꞌin kapayapaan. <verse eid="EPH 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16"/>Alwan dilin hayin, gamitin yu mêt bilang panyangay pananampalataya yu takay ah kawu tablan libun panunuksun Satanas ya dapay panaꞌ ya nagliliyab. <verse eid="EPH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17"/>Ihambalilu yuy tinanggap yun kaligtasan, buy gamitin yu bilang katanay nunghung Apu Diyus ya kaluub Ispiritu na. <verse eid="EPH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18"/>Buy manalangin kawu ha laataꞌ uras ha tulung Ispiritun Apu Diyus. Nu manalangin kawu magmakaingalu kawu buy mikikwa kana. Ah kawu magpabaya buy patuluy kawun manalangin laluy na para ha laataꞌ pinili na.<verse eid="EPH 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19"/>Ipanalangin yu ku mêt amun mangaralaku, ya biyan nakun Apu Diyus taman pannungnunghung takay maipangaral kun buun tapangaꞌ Mahampataꞌ Balitan inlihim hinhatu. <verse eid="EPH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20"/>Ta inꞌutuhakun Apu Diyus takay mangaral awun Mahampataꞌ Balita ya dahilan pagkakakulung ku. Kaya ipanalangin yun maipangaral kun buung tapangaꞌ ati ta atiyaꞌ nararapat.<verse eid="EPH 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Libun Pangwakasaꞌ Pangungumusta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21"/>Hi Tykicus, ya minamaal tamun patêl buy tapataꞌ lingkud Panginuun, ya maybalita kayun laat tungkul kangku, takay matandan yuy kalagayan ku buy nu hita panggawꞌên ku. <verse eid="EPH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22"/>Atiyaꞌ dahilan angkaya pinalaku ku ya kayu takay matandan yuy tungkul kanyan buy palakasên nay luub yu.<verse eid="EPH 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23"/>Pawpatêl, dalangin kun mapakayuy kapayapaan, pagmamaal buy pananamapalatayang ibat kan Apu Diyus ya Bapa tamu buy kan Apu Jesu Cristo. <verse eid="EPH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24"/>Labay kun mamirmi ya kahampatan Apu Jesu Cristo ha laat nagmamaal kanan alang anggan.<verse eid="EPH 6:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6"/>
</usx>
